!!
!!      Revision History:
!!
!![1] 08/18/93 ESE      NEW: security added.
!!
!![2] 02/07/94 ESE      NEW: support ULAN local printer support.
!!
!![3] 03/18/94 RLC      FIX: Remote PC printing with  ULAN.
!!
!![4] 06/06/94 ESE      NEW: Support TOMSG, new PC print.
!!
!![5]  06/13/94 CAE     FIX: Corrected printout of User ID on report.
!!                           IH: need .R
!!
!!7.4   09/30/95 CAE    New version created
!!
!!8.0  02/04/97 CAE     New version created
!!
!![6]  02/04/97 CAE     NEW: Changes for year 2000.
!!
!!A note about the schema and stack and various modes of this program:
!!      There are really three modes to this program for two different
!!      ways of executing a report.
!!
!!              1. User chooses execution in foreground (current user job):
!!
!!              2. User chooses execution in background (BGP job):
!!
!!                      a. This program runs in foreground
!!                         and sets up the stack and places this
!!                         program on the QUEUE for execution
!!
!!                      b. This program runs in BGP job and uses
!!                         information set in 2a above.
!!
!!
!!The program logic is as follows:
!!
!!      First we always LDUSR, check pass security, then ...
!!        (Checks first byte of PWASTR only to determine if allowed to run)
!!
!!      Find out if we are running in background (IN'BGP = 1)
!!
!!              If we are in background (2b above):
!!                     -retrieve standard PQU info which occurs in report macros
!!                     -call SET'USR'DATA and retrieve user info placed
!!                              on stack (in 2a above).  I suggest using
!!                              SETUSR macro.
!!                     -execute report beginning at BEGIN
!!                     -exit program at ABORT if abnormal, or NORMAL'BGP'FINISH
!!                              if all is OK
!!
!!
!!              If not in background then we:
!!                      -calls STANDARD'SCREEN and get standard PQU
!!                              questions answered.  Programmer may
!!                              modify this screen (VICSRP.S[11,10])
!!                              to input user data
!!                      -calls PUT'USR'DATA where you may make your
!!                              own input screen and MUST put any
!!                              user data onto stack if PRW'STK # "N"
!!                              (or use PUTUSR macro).
!!                      -IF PRW'STK = "Y" then we go into mode 2a above:
!!                              -Setup PQU for standard stack data
!!                              -exit program at END'AFTER'PUT'ON'STACK
!!                                      on normal exit, ABORT on abnormal
!!                      -IF PRW'STK = "N" then we go into mode 2b above
!!                              -execute report beginning at BEGIN
!!                              -exit program at ABORT if abnormal,
!!                                      or NORMAL'FINISH if normal exit
!!
!!Note:  unlike the old model this program does not exit to perform
!!       a SELECTOR select/sort ... so nothing needs saving on the QUEUE
!!       etc.  For those who care, XCALL LINK is used to execute SCHEMA
!!
SIGNIFICANCE 11

!!Program control globals

!!The below six globals set records to be put on and retrieved off of
!!the PQD stack for BGP operation.  They are also used in TITLES macro
!!so that FUNC-W and FUNC-R will write and read the saved values.
!!
GLOBAL PASREC1="TLT'REC"
GLOBAL PASREC2="CMN'REC"
!GLOBAL PASREC3="MY3'REC"
!GLOBAL PASREC4="MY4'REC"
!GLOBAL PASREC5="MY5'REC"
!GLOBAL PASREC6="MY6'REC"


GLOBAL SCHEMA'TEST="N"          !!Changes PUTUSR and SETUSR behavior
                                !!and MUST be 'N' if using old select
                                !!otherwise 'Y' regardless of below global

GLOBAL ALLOW'SCHEMA="N"         !!Causes standard report macros to copy
                                !!in SCHEMA logic.  Without this NO
                                !!select or sort can ever be peformed

GLOBAL PROGRAM'FILL="N"         !!If 'Y' will allow program to
                                !!fill particular values into select/sort
                                !!areas of USRHDR.  See PRGM'FILL'SLH

GLOBAL ABORT'NOSL="N"           !!If 'Y' will abort when 0 records selected
                                !!If 'N' will ask screen questions again
                                !!If 'C' will continue through program flow

        !!The following globals directly affect SELECT.MAC[16,14]
        !!Which does the actual selection process.  Set the key packets
        !!in the label "SET'START'END'KEYS" below.

GLOBAL STARTKEY="STR'KEY"       !!MODIFY: If set, will cause primary key to
                                !!start at given value.  Replace STR'KEY
                                !!with your key packet and set key to starting
                                !!values.

GLOBAL ENDKEY="END'KEY" !!MODIFY: If set, will cause primary key to
                                !!stop at given value.  Replace END'KEY
                                !!with your key packet and set key to ending
                                !!values.  If using STARTKEY above, make sure
                                !!you use different key packets!!

        !!The following globals are use in VICSRP.S[11,10]
        !!which is the screen used in STANDARD'SCREEN
        !!They are the defaults to the fields on that screen, name of
        !!the screen, and edit routines on that screen.

        !!The defaults MUST have three quotes if literals
        !!or single quotes if variables

SYMBOL SCREEN="POL940"          !!Default screen
GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'SUM="""N"""     !!Default for Summary option (Y/N)
GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'SEL="""N"""     !!Default for Select/Sort option (Y/N)
!GLOBAL PRW'SEL'EDITS = "ADDITIONAL EDITS ON PRW'SEL"  !!Enable if you
                                !!need more than standard edit for PRW'SEL

                !!These second two must be "" (NO default)
                !!or numbers or a variable

GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'SCHEMA=""       !!Default for Schema number in (####)
CIF DFLT'PRW'SCHEMA = "" THEN
        GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'SCHEMA="SPACE"  !!Default for Schema number in (####)
ENDCIF

GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'HEADER=""       !!Default for Schema header in (####)
CIF DFLT'PRW'HEADER = "" THEN
        GLOBAL DFLT'PRW'HEADER="SPACE"  !!Default for Schema header in (####)
ENDCIF

!GLOBAL USER'SELECT="LABLE'NAME" !!To perform your own \SELECT macro call

!!Standard file definitions:
!!
        COPYF   "USRFIL[SY]",NOAFR
        COPYF   "USRKEY[SY]"
        COPYF "CMNFIL[SY]"


!!Standard copied maps:
!!
        \SSRPTMAPS                      !! SSRPT.MAC

!!User file definitions and maps
                                        !!MODIFY:  add your maps and
                                        !!         COPYF's here

!!Skip fields on STANDARD'SCREEN parameters

        MAP1    MULTI'LOC,S,1
        MAP1    NOSEL,B,1,1             ! Set = to 1 to bypass Selection choice
        MAP1    NOSUM,B,1,1             ! Set = to 1 to bypass Summary choice
        MAP1    NOSTACK,B,1,1           ! Set = to 1 to bypass stack choice
        MAP1    NOSCHEMA,B,1,1          ! Set = to 1 to bypass SCHEMA choice
        MAP1    NOHEADER,B,1,1          ! Set = to 1 to bypass HEADER choice
!!Skip fields in SELECT program paramaters (defined in HEADER PRW'HEADER)
!!                                         (and defined by PRW'SCHEMA   )

        MAP1    NOSRT,B,1               ! Set = to 1 to disallow change of
                                        ! SORT parameters in the passed header.
        MAP1    NOSLCT,B,1              ! Set = to 1 to disallow change of
                                        ! the SELECT parameters in the
                                        ! passed header
        MAP1    NOSEE,B,1               ! Set = to 1 to not LINK to SELECT
                                        ! and sort screen at ... not allow
                                        ! user to see or modifiy the
                                        ! passed header that will still
                                        ! be used for select and sort.
        MAP1    NOCOPIES,B,1,0          ! Set # to 0 to bypass COPIES choice
                                        ! and hard code number of copies
!!Misc user parameters

        MAP1    DSK                     ! USR Params for RPT Stack
                MAP2    DEV,S,3
                MAP2    DRV,S,2
        MAP1    PPN,S,7

        MAP1    FORMID,S,6
        MAP1    H'QUE,B,1,60            ! Standard Hold Que
        MAP1    P'QUE,B,1,20            ! Standard Process Que

        MAP1    ASKEXT,S,1              ! Ask any key to Exit in select/sort

                                        !                       to print
        MAP1    LV,F,6,1                ! Start level - do not change

        MAP1    RP'GROUP,S,1            ! Group headers (Y-N)
        MAP1    RP'SKIP,B,1             ! Break line skip count
        MAP1    SAV'PRTNO,S,4           ! Save area for AFRing
        COPY "FORMAD"

        COPY "CVTMAP"
        COPYF "WRKFIL[IN]",NOAFR
        COPYF "OC2FIL[OE]",NOAFR

        \COPYF LST MC LST2
        \COPYF CMP SY
        \COPYF MSG SY
        \COPYF HDR PO MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF LIN PO MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF SUB PO MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF UCC PO
        \COPYF BLF PO MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF VEN AP MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF TRH AR MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF HDR OE OEHDR
        \COPYF LIN OE OELIN
        \COPYF SUB OE OESUB
        \COPYF BOX OE OEBOX
        \COPYF TAD OE MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF LOC IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF VIA IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF UOM IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF PRH IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF ATT IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF TBL IN MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF RZC UP MODE="PRI"
        \COPYF LST MC
        \COPYF EXT MC
        \COPYF CUS AR
        \COPYF ATQ CV
        \COPYF UPS IN

        MAP1 MY'LOC,B,2
        MAP1 CREATE'ONE'PO,S,1
        MAP1 ALL'DONE,F
        MAP1 RELEASED,B,1,0
        MAP1 SKIPPED'ORDER,B,4,0
        MAP1 EMAIL'NAME,S,80
        MAP1 EMAIL'COMMAND,S,80
        MAP1 TMP'FNAME,S,80
        MAP1 ENCODE'COMMAND,S,80
        MAP1 EMAIL'ADMIN,S,20
        MAP1 EMAIL'FILE'NAME,S,50
        MAP1 PO'STARTED,B,1
        MAP1 ECNT,B,5
        MAP1 PERR,B,1
        MAP1 POCNT,B,5
        MAP1 TOTAL,B,5
        MAP1 BUS'PHONE,S,15
        MAP1 TYPE'OF'DOCUMENT,S,3
        MAP1 TOTAL'QUANTITY,B,5
        MAP1 NUM'OF'RECORDS,B,2
        MAP1 OLD'NUM'OF'RECORDS,B,2
        MAP1 OESUB'II,F
        MAP1 BERROR,B,1
        MAP1 BASE,S,128
        MAP1 DIR,S,128
        MAP1 TWO'NAME,S,128,"/logs/pol940.DAILY"
        MAP1 I,F
        MAP1 II,F
        MAP1 WNAME,S,128
        MAP1 BNAME,S,128
        MAP1 OUTNAME,S,128
        MAP1 PURPOSE,S,1
        MAP1 EASI'SENDER'ID,S,15
        MAP1 LINE'ITEM'COUNTER,B,3
        MAP1 DID'ANYTHING,B,1

        MAP1 EASI'HEADER                   !!Header
            MAP2 HEADER,S,2
            MAP2 TRANS'TYPE,S,3
            MAP2 TRANS'SET'PURPOSE,S,2
            MAP2 VERSION'NUMBER,S,3
            MAP2 PO'TYPE'CODE,S,2
            MAP2 WHOLESALER'PO'NUMBER,S,22
            MAP2 PO'DATE,S,8
            MAP2 PO'TIME,S,6
            MAP2 CUSTOMER'PO'NUMBER,S,30
            MAP2 CURRENCY'CODE,S,3
            MAP2 PO'ACCOUNT'ID,S,12
            MAP2 STORE'ID,S,9
            MAP2 VENDOR'ID,S,10
            MAP2 CONTACT'NAME,S,45
            MAP2 FOB,S,2
            MAP2 SALES'CODE'SHIPMENT,S,2
            MAP2 SALES'CODE'TRUCK,S,2
            MAP2 SALES'CODE'SHIP'DATE,S,2
            MAP2 SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE,S,2
            MAP2 COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE,S,3
            MAP2 PAYMENT'TERMS'DISCOUNT,S,4
            MAP2 PAYMENT'TERMS'DAYS,S,3
            MAP2 PAYMENT'DUE'DAYS,S,3
            MAP2 SPECIFIC'PAYMENT'DATE,S,8
            MAP2 LITERAL'PAYMENT'TERMS,S,45
            MAP2 REQUESTED'SHIP'DATE,S,8
            MAP2 DELIVERY'OPTION,S,15
            MAP2 CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS,S,4
            MAP2 CANCEL'DATE,S,8
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'COMPANY,S,45
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'CONTACT,S,30
            MAP2 RECEIVERS'PHONE,S,20
            MAP2 RECEIVERS'EMAIL,S,50
            MAP2 ACCOUNT'NUMBER,S,20
            MAP2 NAME'OF'ACCOUNT,S,45
            MAP2 TRACKING'ID,S,45
            MAP2 PURCHASERS'ACCOUNT'ID,S,45
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'ADDR1,S,30
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'ADDR2,S,30
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'CITY,S,30
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'STATE,S,2
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'ZIP,S,11
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'COUNTRY,S,3
            MAP2 DROP'SHIP'CODE,S,1
            MAP2 SPEC'DELIVERY'INSTRUCTIONS,S,90
            MAP2 SPEC'ORDER'INSTRUCTIONS,S,90
            MAP2 COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL,S,1
            MAP2 COD'TAGS'INDICATOR,S,1
            MAP2 THIRD'PARTY'ACCOUNT,S,20
            MAP2 DELIVER'TO'COUNTY,S,30
            MAP2 PROMO'CODE,S,20

        MAP1 PO'DETAIL                !!PO detail
            MAP2 DETAIL'CODE,S,2
            MAP2 LINE'ITEM'NUM,S,4
            MAP2 ITEM'ID'GTIN,S,14
            MAP2 MASTER'STYLE,S,10
            MAP2 COLOR'CODE,S,7
            MAP2 SIZE'CODE,S,7
            MAP2 QUANTITY'ORDERED,S,10
            MAP2 PO'UOM,S,2
            MAP2 SELLING'UNIT'PRICE,S,10
            MAP2 TOTAL'LINE'ITEM,S,10

        MAP1 OTHER'CHARGES'REC        !!Other charges record
            MAP2 OTHER'CHARGES,S,2
            MAP2 OC'LINE'ITEM'NUM,S,2
            MAP2 OTHER'CHARGE'DESC,S,45
            MAP2 OTHER'CHARGE'AMT,S,10

        MAP1 TRAILER                  !!Trailer record
            MAP2 TRAILER'RECORD,S,2
            MAP2 RECORD'COUNT,S,7
            MAP2 TOTAL'QUANTITY'ORDERED,S,10
            MAP2 NUMBER'OF'CASES,S,7
            MAP2 TOTAL'PO'AMOUNT,S,14


ON ERROR GOTO ERTRAP

BEGIN:
!!Can't have any database calls before getcmn
        GETCMN
        IF IN'BGP = 0 THEN
            CMN'REC = PASS'SEL'REC
        ENDIF
        \READCTL APID="PO" GL="N"
        \READCTL APID="IN" GL="N"
        \READCTL APID="AR" GL="N"
        \READCTL APID="SA" GL="N"
        \READCTL APID="MC" GL="N"
        \READCTL APID="OE" GL="N"
        USE OEC UB'CNO INTO OEC'REC
        USE OC2 UB'CNO INTO OC2'REC
        IF OC2'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot read OC2!"
            CALL DO'ERRL
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF
        \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP po1hob_A4_ucc_no A4'UCC'NO
        \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP po1hob_DYE_ucc_no DYE'UCC'NO

                        !!         with a different area than PASS'SEL'AR
                        !!  If MY'REC <= 998 bytes
                        !!         add following:  MY'REC = PASS'SEL'REC
                        !!
                        !!  If MY'REC > 998 bytes
                        !!        add following:  GETCMN MY'REC
                        !!                        PASS'SEL'REC = MY'REC


                        !!MODIFY:  If you need to do input statements
                        !!         (from a menu or command or .DO file)
                        !!         code as follows:
                        !!
                        !!      IF IN'BGP = 0 THEN
                        !!                      !!Input if not in background
                        !!              INPUT MY'VARIABLE1
                        !!              INPUT MY'VARIABLE2
                        !!      ENDIF
                        !!
                        !!NOTE:  you may also want to test your common area!

        \DOPASS
        \TMREADCTL
        \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.po_multi_store PO'MULTI'STORE
        PQD'DATA = "Direct Shipment PO"
        PQU'PROG = "POL940"

        \VICSRPT                                !!SSRPT.MAC

        CALL MAKE'940
        IF IN'BGP CALL NORMAL'BGP'FINISH ELSE CALL NORMAL'FINISH
END


!!Exit routines - one for each type of possible exit!!


ABORT:                          !!Used for abnormal exit of program
                                !!such as error conditions or user
                                !!voluntary exit.
        IF IN'BGP CALL NORMAL'BGP'FINISH ELSE CALL NORMAL'FINISH

        IF PO'STARTED = 1 THEN
            ECNT = ECNT + 1
            PERR = 1
        ENDIF
        IF TST'FUNC # 1 THEN
            IF PO'STARTED = 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "SEVERE ERROR: Program aborted badly!"
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO FINAL'END
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
END

END'AFTER'PUT'ON'STACK:         !!Normal exit after report has been QUEUE'd
                !!MODIFY:  if you need to do a SNDCMN upon completion, one
                !!                 goes here and in NORMAL'FINISH
END

MAP1 NORMAL'FINISH,B,1

NORMAL'FINISH:                          !!Normal exit after report compelted
        NORMAL'FINISH = 1
        CALL CLEAN'UP
                !!MODIFY:  if you need to do a SNDCMN upon completion, one
                !!                 goes here and in END'AFTER'PUT'ON'STACK
RETURN

NORMAL'BGP'FINISH:                      !!Normal exit after report completed
                                        !!running on BGP
        NORMAL'FINISH = 1
        CALL CLEAN'UP
RETURN

CLEAN'UP:               !!Called unless case 2a above (just put rpt on stack)
                        !!including ABORT, BGP, etc.
                        !!MODIFY:  release any record locks, close files, etc.
        CIF ALLOW'SCHEMA = "Y" THEN
                CALL FREE'SELECT'WORK'FILE
        ENDCIF
        IF CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "POKEDT" OR CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "POSUNE" THEN
            IF NORMAL'FINISH = 1 THEN
                CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "GOOD"
            ELSE
                CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "BAD"
            ENDIF
            SNDCMN CMN'REC
        ENDIF
RETURN

!! Standard report module subroutines !!

COPYR   "POL940"
                                !!MODIFY:  if you changed STANDARD'SCREEN
                                !!         to use a different screen.
CIF SCREEN="VICSRP" THEN
        COPY    "DSK0:VICSRP[11,10]"
CELSE
        COPYS   "|SCREEN|"
ENDCIF
                                !!MODIFY:  if company control or program
                                !!         name changes since you generated
                                !!         this program.
                                !!         VPRGDESC may be used to send
                                !!         a variable as a description
                                !!         rather than PRGDESC which requires
                                !!         a literal.

\SSRPT PRGNAM="POL940" VPRGDESC="PQD'DATA" CMP'CONTROL="Y"
\\TSTFUNC                               !!TSTFNC.MAC


!! User modifyable subroutines !!

DSP'STANDARD'SCREEN:            !! Leave here - used in \WINDOW call
                                !! in select/sort macros
                                !!
                                !! WARNING: NEVER EVER NEVER do ANYTHING
                                !! except the DSP SCREEN when dspsw = 220
                                !! (E.G. put IF  statement around ALL
                                !!  other code)
        IF CMN'FRM'PRGNAM # "POKEDT" AND CMN'FRM'PRGNAM # "POSUNE" THEN
            DSP |SCREEN|
            IF dspsw # 220 THEN
                ENTRY = "For "+PQD'DATA
                ENTRY = SPACE( INT((72 - LEN(ENTRY))/2) ) + ENTRY !!Center it
                CALL DSP'VICSRP'ENTRY
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
RETURN

GDB'STANDARD'SCREEN:            !! Leave here - needed for re-GDB when
                                !! no selections made ... you may make
                                !! your own screen ... but it must have
                                !! all LABELS that are in VICSRP.S

!!      AUTO'ROW = 12           !!MODIFY:  If autoprompting used, set to 1st
                                !!blank line on screen ... already set to 11
                                !!in MAP statement for VICSRP

    IF CMN'FRM'PRGNAM # "POKEDT" AND CMN'FRM'PRGNAM # "POSUNE" THEN
        ENTRY = "*       "      !!Leave blanks!
        XCALL PRTQUE,SS'STACK'TST
        IF UB'PRTSTK = "X" OR NOSTACK = 1 OR SS'STACK'TST = "N" THEN
                ENTRY[2;1] = "X"                !!disable stack option
                PRW'STK = "N"
        ENDIF
        PRW'PRTNO = 1
        PRT'KSEQ = 1
        USE PRT INTO PRT'REC KEY PRT'KEY
        DO
            GETNXT PRT INTO PRT'REC
            IF PRT'CTL # 0 EXIT
            IF PRT'CRT # "Y" THEN
                PRW'PRTNO = PRT'SEQ
                EXIT
            ENDIF
        LOOP

!!      IF UB'PRTOVR # 0 THEN
                ENTRY[3;1] = "X"                !!disable printer option
!!              PRW'PRTNO = UB'PRTOVR
!!      ENDIF
        IF NOSUM = 1 THEN
                ENTRY[4;1] = "X"                !!disable summary option
                PRW'SUM = "N"
        ENDIF
        IF NOCOPIES = 0 THEN                    !!disable copies option
                ENTRY[8;1] = "X"
                PRW'COPIES = NOCOPIES
        ENDIF

        CIF ALLOW'SCHEMA = "Y" THEN
                IF NOSEL = 1 THEN

!!MODIFY:  to force a select/sort without giving the user a choice you
!!         must set PRW'SEL = "Y", and set PRW'SCHEMA and optionally
!!         set PRW'HEADER ... you may want to set NOSRT and NOSLCT to
!!         prevent the user from changing the preset SCHEMA header.
!!         If you leave PRW'HEADER = 0 all records will be selected
!!         (e.g. select ALL and SORT them) unless you leave NOSLCT = 0
!!         to allow the user to enter selection criteria.

                        ENTRY[5;1] = "X"        !!disable select option
                        PRW'SEL = "N"
                        ENTRY[6;1] = "X"        !!disable schema option
                        PRW'SCHEMA = 0
                        ENTRY[7;1] = "X"        !!disable header option
                        PRW'HEADER = 0
                ENDIF
                IF NOSCHEMA = 1 THEN ENTRY[6;1] = "X"   !!disable schema option
                IF NOHEADER = 1 THEN ENTRY[7;1] = "X"   !!disable header option
        CELSE
                ENTRY[5;1] = "X"
                PRW'SEL = "N"
                ENTRY[6;1] = "X"
                PRW'SCHEMA = 0
                ENTRY[7;1] = "X"
                PRW'HEADER = 0
        ENDCIF
        IF INSTR(1,ENTRY,"X") # 0 THEN
                \AFR EDIT="N"
        ENDIF
        MAP1 PO'MULTI'STORE,S,1
        IF PO'MULTI'STORE = "Y" THEN
            \GAFR |SCREEN| AFR="E:WRK'STORE'ID" EDIT="N"
        ELSE
            \GAFR |SCREEN| AFR="X:WRK'STORE'ID" EDIT="N"
        ENDIF
!       See global of PASREC1 - PASREC6 to pass records
        CIF V''GENCODES = "Y" THEN
                \TITLES |SCREEN| ACTION="SET'TITLES"
        CELSE
                GDB |SCREEN|
        ENDCIF
        CALL TST'FUNC
        IF TST'FUNC = 1 THEN
            ABORT'FLAG = 1
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF
        MAP1 ABORT'FLAG,B,1
    ELSE
        PRW'PRTNO = 1
        PRT'KSEQ = 1
        USE PRT INTO PRT'REC KEY PRT'KEY
        DO
            GETNXT PRT INTO PRT'REC
            IF PRT'CTL # 0 EXIT
            IF PRT'CRT # "Y" THEN
                PRW'PRTNO = PRT'SEQ
                EXIT
            ENDIF
        LOOP
        PRW'COPIES = 1
        PRW'SEL = "N"
        PRW'SUM = "N"
        PRW'STK = "N"
        PRW'SCHEMA = 0
        PRW'HEADER = 0
        MAP1 PASS'AREA
            MAP2 PASS'UCC'NO,S,10
            MAP2 PASS'STORE'ID,S,9
            MAP2 PASS'TMODE,S,1
        PASS'AREA = CMN'OTHER
        WRK'UCC'NO = PASS'UCC'NO
        WRK'STORE'ID = PASS'STORE'ID
        WRK'SUMMARY = PASS'TMODE
        WRK'TYP'NO = CMN'SAV'RCN(1)
        WRK'LOC'NO = CMN'SAV'RCN(2)
        WRK'STRK'NO = CMN'SAV'RCN(3)
        WRK'MODE = CMN'SAV'RCN(4)
        \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.aa_ucc_no AA'UCC'NO
        IF DG'CTL = 0 AND AA'UCC'NO # "" THEN
            IF STR(AA'UCC'NO) = WRK'UCC'NO THEN
                \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.gildan_ucc_no GILDAN'UCC'NO
                IF DG'CTL = 0 AND GILDAN'UCC'NO # "" THEN
                    WRK'UCC'NO = GILDAN'UCC'NO
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 LL,F

SET'TITLES:
        IF PRW'SEL = "Y" THEN LL = 4 ELSE LL = 3
RETURN

E'PRTNO:
                                !!MODIFY:  if custom STANDARD'SCREEN
        \TABPRT
RETURN

SET'ASKEXT:
        ASKEXT = PRT'CRT
RETURN

PUT'USR'DATA:

        !!  MODIFY:  modify the following as needed
        !!  This is where user defined parameters are entrered and then if
        !!  PRW'STK # "N" then the data must be "stacked" on the PQD file
        !!  for later use.

        !!VICS macros make the below typical:

!!      DSP |SCREEN|                            !!It may be better to
!!                                              !!change STANDARD'SCREEN
!!                                              !!instead of having a second
!!      GDB |SCREEN|                            !!screen here ...
!!      CALL TST'FUNC : IF TST'FUNC = 1 GOTO ABORT
!!      See global of PASREC1 - PASREC6 to pass records
        \PUTUSR                                 !!this part is always needed
                                                !!when user data is saved

!!To get multiple records stacked on PQD code as follows:
!!
!!      \PUTUSR WR1'REC WR2'REC WR3'REC ... etc.
!!
!!Make sure and read them off in SETUSR in the same order!

RETURN

SET'USR'DATA:

        !!   This is where the PQD'DATA is pulled in for Print Execution.
        !!   PQU'DTAPTR contains the 1st record. See above for layout
        !!   This routine will only be called if executed by stack
        !!   in the background execution mode.

!VICS macros make the below typical:
!       See global of PASREC1 - PASREC6 to pass records

        \SETUSR

RETURN

CHECK'SCHEMA:
                !!MODIFY:  Set SF = 1 to skip a schema during tabbing
                !!         and disallow it for use in this report.
        CIF ALLOW'SCHEMA = "Y" THEN
                IF SCH'PDBID[1;5] # "ARTCD"[1;5] THEN SF = 1
        ENDCIF
RETURN

CHECK'HEADER:
                !!MODIFY:  Set SF = 1 to skip a header during tabbing
                !!         and disallow it for use in this report.
RETURN

CIF STARTKEY OR ENDKEY THEN
        COPYF "HDRKEY",=STR
        COPYF "HDRKEY",=END
        CIF ALLOW'SCHEMA # "Y" THEN
                ERROR - Why set start or end key if schema not used?
        ENDCIF

        SET'START'END'KEYS:
                !!MODIFY:  Set starting and ending key values from here.
                !!         If stack is allowed then remember to save what
                !!         is needed in PUTUSR and SETUSR.
                !!         Be SURE and set the company number to UB'CNO
                !!         as selector will not set it for you!
        RETURN
ENDCIF

CIF PROGRAM'FILL = "Y" THEN
        CIF ALLOW'SCHEMA # "Y" THEN
                ERROR - Why set program fill if schema not used?
        ENDCIF
PRGM'FILL'SLH:
!!      ! MODIFY:  Here is where you can force a sort and select
!!      !          using SCHEMA.
!!
!!      \FORCE'SORT DBID="APCAT" SORT="DESC" ORDER="A"
!!              ! CLR="N" &     Only if you do not want sort area cleared.
!!              ! OCCUR="1"     Only if you want specify which field. (1-6)
!!      ! Call this macro up to six times to force sort fields.
!!      !Note: Field sorting order is order of macro occurance.
!!
!!      \FORCE'FLD DBID="APDOC" FIELD="NO" COMP="GT" VALUE="10"
!!              ! CONT="AND" ST'PAREN="(" EN'PAREN=")"  ! Optional here on
!!              ! DETAIL'NO=1   ! Normally not passed because fields are added
!!                              ! Set this to # of existing FIELD to change.
!!
!!      \FORCE'FLD DETAIL'NO="SLD'NO" CONT=" "
!!              ! USE ABOVE TO CLEAR LAST CONTINUATION WHEN IF STATEMENTS
!!              ! ARE USED TO SET SELECT FIELDS
!!
!!      ! Call this macro for each field in the selection.
!!
RETURN
ENDCIF

MAKE'940:                   !!MODIFY - add your reporting logic here
    WNAME = "/tmp/work.PID"
    XCALL ABUTIL,46,WNAME,WNAME
    BNAME = "/tmp/bwork.PID"
    XCALL ABUTIL,46,BNAME,BNAME
    OPEN #123,BNAME,OUTPUT
    CLOSE #123

    XCALL ABUTIL,46,TWO'NAME,TWO'NAME

    IF POC'DUNS'NUM[1;1] = 0 THEN
        EASI'SENDER'ID = POC'DUNS'NUM[2;8]
        CHANGED'FLAG = 1
    ELSE
        EASI'SENDER'ID = POC'DUNS'NUM
    ENDIF

    MAP1 AA'UCC'NO,S,10
    MAP1 GILDAN'UCC'NO,S,10

    UCC'KNO = WRK'UCC'NO
    USE UCC INTO UCC'REC KEY UCC'KEY
    IF UCC'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot find ucc number"
        \KERROR UCC MODE="KEY" APID="PO" CNO="N"
        CALL DO'ERR
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        ABORT'FLAG = 1
        GOTO ABORT
    ELSE
        IF PO'MULTI'STORE = "Y" THEN
            UCD'KUCC'NO = UCC'NO
            UCD'KSTORE'ID = WRK'STORE'ID
            USE UCD INTO UCD'REC KEY UCD'KEY
            IF UCD'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "1: Cannot find store number"
                \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" APID="PO" CNO="N"
                CALL DO'ERR
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                ABORT'FLAG = 1
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                CALL LOOKUP'PO
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            UCD'KUCC'NO = UCC'NO
            UCD'KSTORE'ID = 0
            USE UCD INTO UCD'REC KEY UCD'KEY
            DO
                GETNXT UCD INTO UCD'REC
                IF UCD'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "2: Cannot find store number"
                    \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" APID="PO" CNO="N"
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    ABORT'FLAG = 1
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF
                IF UCD'LOC'NO = WRK'LOC'NO THEN
                    UCD'KSTORE'ID = UCD'STORE'ID
                    CALL LOOKUP'PO
                    EXIT
                ELSE
                    IF UCD'LOC'NO < WRK'LOC'NO THEN
                        REPEAT
                    ELSE
                        ENTRY = "Cannot find location setup on UCC"
                        \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" APID="PO" CNO="N"
                        CALL DO'ERR
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                        ABORT'FLAG = 1
                        GOTO ABORT
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
            LOOP
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

FINAL'END:
    CMN'FRM'PRGNAM = "BAD"
    SNDCMN CMN'REC
END

LOOKUP'PO:
    HDR'KDOC'TYPE = WRK'MODE
    HDR'KNO = WRK'STRK'NO
    USE HDR INTO HDR'REC KEY HDR'KEY
    IF HDR'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot find purchase order to create 940 "+HDR'KDOC'TYPE+"-"+HDR'KNO
        CALL DO'ERR
        ABORT'FLAG = 1
        GOTO ABORT
    ENDIF
    IF HDR'SHIPMENT > 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot create 940 on a purchase order that has receipts!"
        \KERROR HDR APID="PO" CNO="N"
        CALL DO'ERR
        ABORT'FLAG = 1
        GOTO ABORT
    ENDIF
    IF HDR'LSTID = "POL940" THEN
        IF WRK'SUMMARY # "Y" THEN
            ENTRY = "940 has already been sent for this purchase order!"
            \KERROR HDR APID="PO" CNO="N"
            CALL DO'ERR
            ABORT'FLAG = 1
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    CALL ADD'940
RETURN

ADD'940:
    TYPE'OF'DOCUMENT = "940"
    BLF'KNO = WRK'TYP'NO
    CALL FIND'ROUTING'ENVELOPE      !!hobsub.cpy
    CALL CREATE'ENVELOPE'HEADER     !!hobsub.cpy
    CALL MAKE'PO

    MAP1 CRITICAL'ERROR,B,1
    IF CRITICAL'ERROR # 1 THEN
        IF POCNT > 0 THEN
            IF CHANGED'FLAG = 1 THEN
                EASI'SENDER'ID = POC'DUNS'NUM
            ENDIF
            OUTNAME = "/" + BASE + "/out/940_"+EASI'SENDER'ID+"_" + FILE'CREATION'DTT+FILE'CREATION'TIME
            OUTNAME = OUTNAME + ".txt"
            OPEN #33,WNAME,OUTPUT
            PRINT #33, ROUTING'HEADER; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, ROUTING'VERSION'NUMBER; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, SENDER'QUALIFIER; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, SENDER'ID; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, RECEIVER'QUALIFIER; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, RECEIVER'ID; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, FILE'CREATION'DTT; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, FILE'CREATION'TIME; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, TIME'ZONE; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, PRODUCTION'OR'TEST; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, DOCUMENT'TYPE; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, HEADER'INTERCHANGE'ID;
            PRINT #33, CHR(13) + CHR(10);                   !!CRLF
            CLOSE #33
            ENTRY = "cat "+BNAME+" >>"+WNAME
            XCALL SYSTEM,ENTRY
            CALL CREATE'ENVELOPE'TRAILER        !!hobsub.cpy
            OPEN #33,WNAME,APPEND
            PRINT #33, ROUTING'TRAILER; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, TRAILER'INTERCHANGE'ID; CHR(9);
            PRINT #33, NUMBER'OF'TRAILER'DOCUMENTS;
            PRINT #33, CHR(13) + CHR(10);                   !!CRLF
            CLOSE #33
            LOOKUP OUTNAME,II
            IF II # 0 THEN
                KILL OUTNAME
            ENDIF
            XCALL SYSTEM,"aroot chmod a+rw " +WNAME
            XCALL SYSTEM,"mv "+WNAME+" "+ OUTNAME
            XCALL SYSTEM,"aroot chmod a+rw " +OUTNAME
            LOOKUP BNAME,II
            IF II # 0 THEN
                KILL BNAME
            ENDIF
            LOOKUP WNAME,II
            IF II # 0 THEN
                KILL WNAME
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
    ENDIF

    IF CRITICAL'ERROR = 1 THEN
        ENTRY = "940 not created due to GTIN errors, see /logs/940_error.YYMMDD"
        CALL DO'ERR
    ELSE
        IF ECNT = 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Processed 940 "+POCNT+" perfectly! File is: " + OUTNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
        ELSE
            ENTRY = "Processed 940 " +POCNT+" with "+ECNT+" errors, see /logs/940_error.YYMMDD"
            CALL DO'ERR
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    CALL UPDATE'PO
RETURN

UPDATE'PO:
    HDR'KDOC'TYPE = WRK'MODE
    HDR'KNO = WRK'STRK'NO
    RDLOCK HDR INTO HDR'REC KEY HDR'KEY
    IF HDR'CTL = 0 THEN
        HDR'LSTID = "POL940"
        HDR'LSTDT = DATE
        WRITE HDR FROM HDR'REC
    ELSE
        ENTRY = "Cannot read PO!"
        \KERROR HDR APID="PO" CNO="N"
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        REL HDR
    ENDIF
RETURN

E'WRK'UCC'NO:
    \TABC NPRE="UCC" NKEY="NO" FLDNAM="WRK'UCC'NO" DSPNAM="DSP'UCC'NO" &
        APID="PO" MAND="Y"
    \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.aa_ucc_no AA'UCC'NO
    IF DG'CTL = 0 AND AA'UCC'NO # "" THEN
        IF STR(AA'UCC'NO) = WRK'UCC'NO THEN
            \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.gildan_ucc_no GILDAN'UCC'NO
            IF DG'CTL = 0 AND GILDAN'UCC'NO # "" THEN
                WRK'UCC'NO = GILDAN'UCC'NO
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

E'LOC'NO:
    \TABC FROM="WRK" ON="LOC" DSPFLD="Y" APID="IN" DEFAULT="UB'LOC" &
        DSPLEN="25"
RETURN

E'WRK'TYP'NO:
    \TABC NPRE="BLF" NKEY="NO" FLDNAM="WRK'TYP'NO" DSPNAM="DSP'BLF'NO" &
        APID="PO" MAND="Y" SF'TEST="E'HEADER'SF"
RETURN

E'STORE'ID:
    \TABC APRE="UCD" AKEY="STORE'ID" KFLD1="UCC'NO" BAD1="UCC'NO" &
        FLDNAM="WRK'STORE'ID" APID="PO" DSPNAM="DSP'STORE'DESC"
RETURN

E'HEADER'SF:
    IF BLF'TYPE # "V" OR BLF'DOC'TYPE # "940" THEN
        SF = 2
        ENTRY = "Format must be for 940 PO output!"
    ENDIF
RETURN

MAKE'PO:
    SF = 0
    CALL LOOKUP'OE'ORDER
    CALL LOOKUP'CREDIT'HOLD        !!Look up orders on CC hold
    IF SF = 1 RETURN               !!KLUDGE
    PO'STARTED = 1

    HDR'KDOC'TYPE = WRK'MODE
    HDR'KNO = WRK'STRK'NO
    USE HDR INTO HDR'REC KEY HDR'KEY
    IF HDR'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "PO not found in current: "
        \KERROR HDR MODE="K" CNO="N" APID="PO"
        ENTRY = ENTRY +" for location: "+ WRK'LOC'NO
        CALL DO'ERR
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
    ENDIF

    IF HDR'LSTID = "POL940" THEN
        PURPOSE = "U"                !!Update
    ELSE
        PURPOSE = "F"                !!First time
    ENDIF
    OLD'NUM'OF'RECORDS = NUM'OF'RECORDS

    OPEN #33,WNAME,OUTPUT
    CALL CREATE'940'HEADER
    CALL CREATE'940'DETAIL
    CALL CREATE'940'TRAILER
    CLOSE #33
    IF PERR = 0 THEN
        POCNT = POCNT + 1
        ENTRY = "cat "+WNAME+" >>"+BNAME
        XCALL SYSTEM,ENTRY
        ALL'DONE = 1
    ELSE
        NUM'OF'RECORDS = OLD'NUM'OF'RECORDS
        PERR = 0
    ENDIF
    KILL WNAME
RETURN


CREATE'940'HEADER:
        NUM'OF'RECORDS = 0
        EASI'HEADER = SPACE

        HEADER = "01"
        PRINT #33, HEADER; CHR(9);

        TRANS'TYPE = "940"
        PRINT #33, TRANS'TYPE; CHR(9);

        IF PURPOSE = "F" THEN
            TRANS'SET'PURPOSE = "00"        !!00=Original, 07=Duplicate
            PRINT #33, TRANS'SET'PURPOSE; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            TRANS'SET'PURPOSE = "07"        !!16=Proposed, 22=Information copy
            PRINT #33, TRANS'SET'PURPOSE; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        USE BLF INTO BLF'REC KEY BLF'KEY
        IF BLF'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot find interface format to process 940!"
            \KERROR BLF APID="PO" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for format " + BLF'KNO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            IF BLF'DOC'TYPE = "940" THEN
                VERSION'NUMBER = BLF'VERSION
                PRINT #33, VERSION'NUMBER; CHR(9);
                IF BLF'FILE'NAME[1;1] = "/" THEN
                    BLF'FILE'NAME = BLF'FILE'NAME[2,-1]
                    JJ = INSTR(1,BLF'FILE'NAME,"/")
                    IF JJ # 0 THEN
                        BASE = BLF'FILE'NAME[1,JJ-1]
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

        PO'TYPE'CODE = "SA"
        PRINT #33, PO'TYPE'CODE; CHR(9);

        WHOLESALER'PO'NUMBER = HDR'NO
        PRINT #33, WHOLESALER'PO'NUMBER; CHR(9);

        \STRDTT DTT="HDR'ORDER'DTT" YYMMDD="Y" CDATE="PO'DATE"
        PO'DATE = "20" +PO'DATE
        PRINT #33, PO'DATE CHR(9);

        \S'TO'HMS
        ENTRY = (HRS USING "#Z")+(MNS USING "#Z")+(SEC USING "#Z")
        PO'TIME = ENTRY
        PRINT #33, PO'TIME; CHR(9);

        IF OEHDR'PO # "" THEN
            CUSTOMER'PO'NUMBER = OEHDR'PO
            PRINT #33, CUSTOMER'PO'NUMBER; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            \S'TO'HMS
            ENTRY = (HRS USING "#Z")+(MNS USING "#Z")+(SEC USING "#Z")
            CUSTOMER'PO'NUMBER = ENTRY
            PRINT #33, CUSTOMER'PO'NUMBER; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        TAD'SPACE = SPACE
        TAD'KBS = "P"
        TAD'KHDR'LOC'NO = 0
        TAD'KDOC'TYPE = HDR'DOC'TYPE
        TAD'KHDR'NO = HDR'NO
        USE TAD INTO TAD'REC KEY TAD'KEY
        IF TAD'CTL = 0 THEN
            CASE
            IF TAD'COUNTRY = "USA" OR TAD'COUNTRY = "US" THEN
                CURRENCY'CODE = "USD"
                PRINT #33, CURRENCY'CODE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
            IF TAD'COUNTRY = "CAN" OR TAD'COUNTRY = "CA" THEN
                CURRENCY'CODE = "CAD"
                PRINT #33, CURRENCY'CODE;  CHR(9);
            ELSE
                CURRENCY'CODE = "EUR"
                PRINT #33, CURRENCY'CODE; CHR(9);
            ENDCASE
        ELSE
            ENTRY = "Country code not on file"
            \KERROR TAD MODE="KEY" CNO="N" APID="OE"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF

        IF UCD'KSTORE'ID = "" THEN
            UCD'CTL = 0
            UCD'VEN'NO = UCC'VEN'NO
            UCD'LOC'NO = UCC'LOC'NO
        ELSE
            UCD'KUCC'NO = UCC'NO
            USE UCD INTO UCD'REC KEY UCD'KEY
            UCC'VEN'NO = UCD'VEN'NO
            UCC'LOC'NO = UCD'LOC'NO
        ENDIF
        IF UCD'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot find UCD number"
            \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" APID="PO" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            IF UCD'VEN'NO = HDR'NAM'NO AND UCD'LOC'NO = OEHDR'LOC'NO THEN
                VEN'SPACE = SPACE
                VEN'KNO = UCD'VEN'NO
                USE VEN INTO VEN'REC KEY VEN'KEY
                IF VEN'CTL = 0 THEN
                    IF VEN'ACCOUNT = "" THEN
                        ENTRY = "Vendor account must be set up"
                        \KERROR VEN MODE="KEY" CNO="N" APID="AP"
                        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                                 OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                        CALL DO'ERR
                        GOTO ABORT
                    ELSE
                        PO'ACCOUNT'ID = VEN'ACCOUNT
                        PRINT #33, PO'ACCOUNT'ID; CHR(9);
                        IF UCD'STORE'ID = "" THEN
                            ENTRY = "Store ID must be set up"
                            \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" CNO="N" APID="PO"
                            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                                     OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                            CALL DO'ERR
                            GOTO ABORT
                        ELSE
                            STORE'ID = UCD'STORE'ID
                            PRINT #33, STORE'ID; CHR(9);
                        ENDIF
                    ENDIF
                ELSE
                    ENTRY = "Vendor account not on file"
                    \KERROR VEN MODE="KEY" CNO="N" APID="AP"
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF
            ELSE
                IF UCD'VEN'NO # HDR'NAM'NO THEN
                    MAP1 AA'VEN'ACCOUNT,S,10
                    \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.aa_ven_account,AA'VEN'ACCOUNT
                    IF DG'CTL = 0 AND AA'VEN'ACCOUNT # 0 THEN
                        PO'ACCOUNT'ID = AA'VEN'ACCOUNT
                        PRINT #33, PO'ACCOUNT'ID; CHR(9);
                        STORE'ID = UCD'STORE'ID
                        PRINT #33, STORE'ID; CHR(9);
                    ENDIF
                ELSE
                    ENTRY = "Ven/loc"
                    \KERROR UCD MODE="KEY" CNO="N" APID="PO"
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " PO="
                    \KERROR HDR MODE="D" CNO="N" APID="PO"
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + "("+STR(HDR'NAM'NO)+"-"+STR(UCD'VEN'NO)+")("+&
                        STR(HDR'LOC'NO)+"-"+STR(UCD'LOC'NO)+")"
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

        VENDOR'ID = UCC'NO
        PRINT #33, VENDOR'ID; CHR(9);

        LOC'SPACE = SPACE
        LOC'KNO = OEHDR'LOC'NO
        USE LOC INTO LOC'REC KEY LOC'KEY
        IF LOC'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot find location"
            \KERROR LOC MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
        ELSE
            LST'SPACE = SPACE
            LSTF'KNO = LOC'LST'NO              !!Contact on location maintenace
            USE LSTF INTO LST'REC KEY LSTF'KEY
            IF LSTF'CTL = 0 THEN
                FOR II = 1 TO 3
                    IF UCS(LST'PTY'NO(II)) = "O" THEN
                        BUS'PHONE = LST'PHONE(II)
                    ENDIF
                NEXT II
                IF LST'PHONE(II) # "" THEN
                    CONTACT'NAME = LST'FIRST + " " + LST'LAST + " " + &
                        BUS'PHONE[1;3]+ "-" + BUS'PHONE[4;3] + "-" + &
                        BUS'PHONE[7;4]
                    PRINT #33, CONTACT'NAME; CHR(9);
                ELSE
                    CONTACT'NAME = LST'FIRST + " " + LST'LAST
                    PRINT #33, CONTACT'NAME; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ELSE
                CONTACT'NAME = ""
                PRINT #33, CHR(9);
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

        FOB = "PP"                            !!PP-Wholesaler pays freight
        PRINT #33, FOB; CHR(9);
                                              !!CC-Purchaser pays freight & UPS account
        SALES'CODE'SHIPMENT = "SC"            !!SC-Ship complete, BK-Ship partial & BO
        PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'SHIPMENT; CHR(9);
                                              !!SP-Ship partial & cancel rest
        SALES'CODE'TRUCK = "LT"
        PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'TRUCK; CHR(9);

        SALES'CODE'SHIP'DATE = "P2"
        PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'SHIP'DATE; CHR(9);

        TRH'SPACE = SPACE
        TRH'KNO = OEHDR'TRH'NO
        USE TRH INTO TRH'REC KEY TRH'KEY
        IF TRH'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "1: Cannot find terms"
            \KERROR TRH MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            CASE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 2 THEN                   !!Business check
                SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE = ""                !!Not blind shipped
                PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 3 THEN                   !!Certified funds
                SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE = ""                !!Not blind shipped
                PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE = "SB"              !!Ship blind
                PRINT #33, SALES'CODE'CONSIGNEE; CHR(9);
            ENDCASE
        ENDIF

        TRH'SPACE = SPACE
        TRH'KNO = OEHDR'TRH'NO
        USE TRH INTO TRH'REC KEY TRH'KEY
        IF TRH'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "2: Cannot find terms"
            \KERROR TRH MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            CASE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 2 THEN                   !!Business check
                COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE = "Y2"
                PRINT #33, COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 3 THEN                   !!Certified funds
                COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE = "Y1"
                PRINT #33, COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE = "N"
                PRINT #33, COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE; CHR(9);
            ENDCASE
            IF TRH'DESC = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "Must set terms description"
                \KERROR TRH MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

        PAYMENT'TERMS'DISCOUNT = ""
        PRINT #33, PAYMENT'TERMS'DISCOUNT; CHR(9);

        PAYMENT'TERMS'DAYS = ""
        PRINT #33, PAYMENT'TERMS'DAYS; CHR(9);

        PAYMENT'DUE'DAYS = ""
        PRINT #33, PAYMENT'DUE'DAYS; CHR(9);

        SPECIFIC'PAYMENT'DATE = ""
        PRINT #33, SPECIFIC'PAYMENT'DATE; CHR(9);

        LITERAL'PAYMENT'TERMS = TRH'DESC
        PRINT #33, LITERAL'PAYMENT'TERMS; CHR(9);

        REQUESTED'SHIP'DATE = ""
        PRINT #33, REQUESTED'SHIP'DATE; CHR(9);

        MAP1 VIA'FROM'PO,S,1
        \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP pol940.via_from_po VIA'FROM'PO
        IF DG'CTL = 0 AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y" THEN
            VIA'SPACE = SPACE
            VIA'KNO = HDR'VIA'NO
            USE VIA INTO VIA'REC KEY VIA'KEY
            IF VIA'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "1: Cannot find ship via"
                \KERROR VIA MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                CALL LOOKUP'VIA
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            VIA'SPACE = SPACE
            VIA'KNO = OEHDR'VIA'NO
            USE VIA INTO VIA'REC KEY VIA'KEY
            IF VIA'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "2: Cannot find ship via"
                \KERROR VIA MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                CALL LOOKUP'VIA
            ENDIF
        ENDIF

        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" THEN
            IF LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "03" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "15" OR &
                LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "01" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "13" OR &
                LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "07" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "02" OR &
                LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "12" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "41" OR &
                LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "44" THEN
                CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS = "UPS"
                PRINT #33, CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS; CHR(9);
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" THEN
                IF LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "01" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "03" OR &
                    LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "05" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "06" OR &
                    LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "20" OR LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "90" OR &
                    LEFT(DELIVERY'OPTION,2) = "92" THEN
                        CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS = "FEDEX"
                        PRINT #33, CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
        IF CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS = "" OR (VIA'MTYPE = "O" AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y") THEN
            PRINT #33, CARRIER'ROUTING'DETAILS; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        CANCEL'DATE = ""
        PRINT #33, CANCEL'DATE; CHR(9);

        IF VIA'MTYPE = "O" AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y" AND HDR'DROP'YN = "L" THEN
            LOC'SPACE = SPACE
            LOC'KNO = HDR'SHP'NO
            USE LOC INTO LOC'REC KEY LOC'KEY
            IF LOC'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Cannot find location"
                \KERROR LOC MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                                 OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
            ELSE
                LST2'SPACE = SPACE
                LSTF'KNO = LOC'LST'NO              !!Contact on location maintenace
                USE LSTF INTO LST2'REC KEY LSTF'KEY
                IF LSTF'CTL = 0 THEN
                    DELIVER'TO'COMPANY = LST2'COMPANY
                    PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'COMPANY; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ELSE
            DELIVER'TO'COMPANY = TAD'COMPANY
            PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'COMPANY; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        DELIVER'TO'CONTACT = ""
        PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'CONTACT; CHR(9);

        IF VIA'MTYPE = "O" AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y" AND HDR'DROP'YN = "L" THEN
            IF LST2'PHONE(1) = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "Enter phone number number on location"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                    OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                RECEIVERS'PHONE = ""
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'PHONE; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                BUS'PHONE = LST2'PHONE(1)
                RECEIVERS'PHONE = BUS'PHONE[1;3]+ "-" + BUS'PHONE[4;3] + &
                        "-" + BUS'PHONE[7;4]
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'PHONE; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            EXT'KLST'NO = LOC'LST'NO
            USE EXT INTO EXT'REC KEY EXT'KEY
            IF EXT'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "External email file not found"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                RECEIVERS'EMAIL = ""
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'EMAIL; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                RECEIVERS'EMAIL = EXT'EMAIL
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'EMAIL; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            LOC'KNO = OEHDR'LOC'NO
            USE LOC INTO LOC'REC KEY LOC'KEY
                IF LOC'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Cannot find drop ship location number!"
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                UPS'KMTYPE = "F"
                UPS'KLOC'NO = LOC'NO
                USE UPS INTO UPS'REC KEY UPS'KEY
                IF UPS'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "Cannot find UPS file to lookup shipper number!"
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    GOTO ABORT
                ELSE
                    ACCOUNT'NUMBER = UPS'SHIPPER
                    PRINT #33, ACCOUNT'NUMBER; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDIF

            USE CMP UB'CNO INTO CMP'REC
            IF CMP'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Must set up company number: "+ CMP'NO
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                NAME'OF'ACCOUNT = CMP'NAME
                PRINT #33, NAME'OF'ACCOUNT; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            TRACKING'ID = OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-"+ &
                     OEHDR'NO + "-" + OEHDR'NAM'NO
            PRINT #33, TRACKING'ID; CHR(9);

            PURCHASERS'ACCOUNT'ID = OEHDR'NAM'NO
            PRINT #33, PURCHASERS'ACCOUNT'ID; CHR(9);

            DELIVER'TO'ADDR1 = LST2'ADDR(1)
            PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR1; CHR(9);

            IF LST2'ADDR2 = "" THEN
                DELIVER'TO'ADDR2 = ""
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR2; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'ADDR2 = LST2'ADDR(2)
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR2; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            IF LST2'CITY = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "City not entered on shipping address"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'CITY = LST2'CITY
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'CITY; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            CASE
            IF LST2'ST = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "State not entered on shipping address"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
            IF LEN(LST2'ST) > 2 OR LEN(LST2'ST) = 1 THEN
                ENTRY = "State must be 2 character abbreviation"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'STATE = LST2'ST
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'STATE; CHR(9);
            ENDCASE

            IF LEN(LST2'ZIP) > 5 THEN
                IF LST2'ZIP[6;4] = "0000" THEN
                    DELIVER'TO'ZIP = LST2'ZIP[1;5]
                    \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                ELSE
                    DELIVER'TO'ZIP = LST2'ZIP[1;9]
                    \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                ENDIF
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ZIP; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'ZIP = LST2'ZIP[1;5]
                \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ZIP; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            DELIVER'TO'COUNTRY = ""
            PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'COUNTRY; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            LST'SPACE = SPACE
            LSTF'KNO = OEHDR'NAM'NO            !!Customer on order
            USE LSTF INTO LST'REC KEY LSTF'KEY
            IF LSTF'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Could not find LST record for customer"
                \KERROR LST APID="MC" CNO="N" MODE="KEY"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                IF LST'PHONE(1) = "" THEN
                    ENTRY = "Customer should have phone number entered"
                    \KERROR LST APID="MC" CNO="N" MODE="KEY"
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    RECEIVERS'PHONE = ""
                    PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'PHONE; CHR(9);
                ELSE
                    BUS'PHONE = LST'PHONE(1)
                    RECEIVERS'PHONE = BUS'PHONE[1;3]+ "-" + BUS'PHONE[4;3] + &
                        "-" + BUS'PHONE[7;4]
                    PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'PHONE; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDIF

            EXT'KLST'NO = OEHDR'NAM'NO
            USE EXT INTO EXT'REC KEY EXT'KEY
            IF EXT'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "External email file not found"
                \KERROR EXT APID="MC" CNO="N" MODE="KEY"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                RECEIVERS'EMAIL = ""
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'EMAIL; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                RECEIVERS'EMAIL = EXT'EMAIL
                PRINT #33, RECEIVERS'EMAIL; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            MAP1 WP'NO'ACCOUNT,S,1
            \DG GETSTRING _POSETUP po1hob_wp_no_account,WP'NO'ACCOUNT
            IF WP'NO'ACCOUNT = "Y" AND UCC'NO = "0820599" THEN
                ACCOUNT'NUMBER = ""
                PRINT #33, ACCOUNT'NUMBER; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                LOC'KNO = OEHDR'LOC'NO
                USE LOC INTO LOC'REC KEY LOC'KEY
                IF LOC'CTL # 0 THEN
                    ENTRY = "Cannot find drop ship location number!"
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    GOTO ABORT
                ELSE
                    IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" THEN
                        UPS'KMTYPE = "U"
                    ELSE
                        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" OR (VIA'MTYPE = "O" AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y") THEN
                            UPS'KMTYPE = "F"
                        ENDIF
                    ENDIF
                    UPS'KLOC'NO = LOC'NO
                    USE UPS INTO UPS'REC KEY UPS'KEY
                    IF UPS'CTL # 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "Cannot find UPS file to lookup shipper number!"
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                        CALL DO'ERR
                        GOTO ABORT
                    ELSE
                        ACCOUNT'NUMBER = UPS'SHIPPER
                        PRINT #33, ACCOUNT'NUMBER; CHR(9);
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
            ENDIF

            USE CMP UB'CNO INTO CMP'REC
            IF CMP'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Must set up company number: "+ CMP'NO
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                NAME'OF'ACCOUNT = CMP'NAME
                PRINT #33, NAME'OF'ACCOUNT; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            TRACKING'ID = OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-"+ &
                     OEHDR'NO + "-" + OEHDR'NAM'NO
            PRINT #33, TRACKING'ID; CHR(9);

            PURCHASERS'ACCOUNT'ID = OEHDR'NAM'NO
            PRINT #33, PURCHASERS'ACCOUNT'ID; CHR(9);

            IF TAD'ADDR1 = "" THEN
                IF TAD'ADDR2 # "" THEN
                    TAD'ADDR1 = TAD'ADDR2
                    DELIVER'TO'ADDR1 = TAD'ADDR1
                    PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR1; CHR(9);
                ELSE
                    ENTRY = "Shipping address required!"
                    \KERROR TAD APID="OE" CNO="N" MODE="KEY"
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                    \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                    CALL DO'ERR
                    GOTO ABORT
                ENDIF
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'ADDR1 = TAD'ADDR1
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR1; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            IF TAD'ADDR2 = "" THEN
                DELIVER'TO'ADDR2 = ""
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR2; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'ADDR2 = TAD'ADDR2
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ADDR2; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            IF TAD'CITY = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "City not entered on shipping address"
                \KERROR TAD APID="OE" CNO="N" MODE="KEY"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'CITY = TAD'CITY
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'CITY; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            CASE
            IF TAD'ST = "" THEN
                ENTRY = "State not entered on shipping address"
                \KERROR TAD APID="OE" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
            IF LEN(TAD'ST) > 2 OR LEN(TAD'ST) = 1 THEN
                ENTRY = "State must be 2 character abbreviation"
                \KERROR TAD APID="OE" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'STATE = TAD'ST
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'STATE; CHR(9);
            ENDCASE

            IF LEN(TAD'ZIP) > 5 THEN
                IF TAD'ZIP[6;4] = "0000" THEN
                    DELIVER'TO'ZIP = TAD'ZIP[1;5]
                    \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                ELSE
                    DELIVER'TO'ZIP = TAD'ZIP[1;9]
                    \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                ENDIF
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ZIP; CHR(9);
            ELSE
                DELIVER'TO'ZIP = TAD'ZIP[1;5]
                \STRIP DELIVER'TO'ZIP 3
                PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'ZIP; CHR(9);
            ENDIF

            DELIVER'TO'COUNTRY = ""
            PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'COUNTRY; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        DROP'SHIP'CODE = "Y"
        PRINT #33, DROP'SHIP'CODE; CHR(9);

        IF OEHDR'BOX'COUNT > 1 THEN
            SPEC'DELIVERY'INSTRUCTIONS = "Pack in " + OEHDR'BOX'COUNT + " boxes."
            PRINT #33, SPEC'DELIVERY'INSTRUCTIONS; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            SPEC'DELIVERY'INSTRUCTIONS = "Pack in " + OEHDR'BOX'COUNT + " box."
            PRINT #33, SPEC'DELIVERY'INSTRUCTIONS; CHR(9);
        ENDIF

        IF OEHDR'PO # "" THEN
            SPEC'ORDER'INSTRUCTIONS = OEHDR'PO
        ENDIF
        PRINT #33, SPEC'ORDER'INSTRUCTIONS; CHR(9);

        VIA'SPACE = SPACE
        VIA'KNO = OEHDR'VIA'NO
        USE VIA INTO VIA'REC KEY VIA'KEY
        IF VIA'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot find via for residential lookup"
            \KERROR VIA MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            CALL LOOKUP'RURAL'ZIP
        ENDIF

        TRH'KNO = OEHDR'TRH'NO
        USE TRH INTO TRH'REC KEY TRH'KEY
        IF TRH'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Order terms not found"
            \KERROR TRH MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            CASE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 1 THEN
                COD'TAGS'INDICATOR = "N"            !!No tags
                PRINT #33, COD'TAGS'INDICATOR; CHR(9);
            ELSE
            IF TRH'COD'STATUS = 2 AND OC2'ONECOD'OVR # "N" THEN  !!Force 1 cod if company check
                COD'TAGS'INDICATOR = "O"            !!One tag
                PRINT #33, COD'TAGS'INDICATOR; CHR(9);
            ELSE
            CUS'KNO = OEHDR'NAM'NO
            USE CUS INTO CUS'REC KEY CUS'KEY
            IF CUS'CTL # 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Customer not found"
                \KERROR CUS MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
                ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                GOTO ABORT
            ELSE
                IF CUS'ONE'COD = "Y" THEN
                    COD'TAGS'INDICATOR = "O"            !!One tag
                    PRINT #33, COD'TAGS'INDICATOR; CHR(9);
                ELSE
                    COD'TAGS'INDICATOR = "M"            !!Multiple tags
                    PRINT #33, COD'TAGS'INDICATOR; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDCASE
        ENDIF

        THIRD'PARTY'ACCOUNT = ""
        PRINT #33, THIRD'PARTY'ACCOUNT; CHR(9);

        DELIVER'TO'COUNTY = ""
        PRINT #33, DELIVER'TO'COUNTY; CHR(9);

        PROMO'CODE = ""
        PRINT #33, PROMO'CODE

        NUM'OF'RECORDS = NUM'OF'RECORDS + 1
        NOTD = NOTD + 1
        PRINT #33, CHR(13) + CHR(10);                   !!CRLF
RETURN

LOOKUP'VIA:
        CASE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" AND VIA'1Z'SERV = "01" AND &
                    VIA'SAT'IND # "Y" THEN   !!UPS Next Day
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "01"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" AND VIA'1Z'SERV = "44" AND &
                    VIA'SAT'IND = "Y" THEN   !!UPS Next Day Saturday
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "44"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" AND VIA'1Z'SERV = "41" AND &
                    VIA'SAT'IND = "Y" THEN   !!UPS Next Day AM Saturday
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "41"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" AND VIA'1Z'SERV = "15" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "15"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" AND VIA'SERV'TYPE = "13" THEN !!UPS Next Day Saver
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "13"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "S" AND VIA'SERV'TYPE = "02" THEN !!UPS 2nd Day
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "02"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "S" AND VIA'SERV'TYPE = "59" THEN !!UPS 2nd Day A.M.
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "07"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "R" THEN                          !!UPS 3rd Day
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "12"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "U" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "C" THEN                          !!UPS Ground
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "03"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "B" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "01"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "G" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "03"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "A" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "05"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "D" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "06"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "F" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "20"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "H" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "90"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "F" AND VIA'MAN'YN = "C" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = "92"
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
        IF VIA'MTYPE = "O" AND VIA'FROM'PO = "Y" THEN
            DELIVERY'OPTION = ""
            PRINT #33, DELIVERY'OPTION; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            ENTRY = "Not one of the available shipment methods"
            \KERROR VIA MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO+" MAN  ="+VIA'MTYPE+" TYPE="+VIA'MAN'YN + &
                " SERV="+VIA'SERV'TYPE
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            SKIPPED'ORDER = OEHDR'RCN
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDCASE
RETURN

CREATE'940'DETAIL:            !!PO detail
    LINE'ITEM'COUNTER = 0
    LIN'KDOC'TYPE = HDR'DOC'TYPE
    LIN'KHDR'NO = HDR'NO
    LIN'KNO = 0
    USE LIN INTO LIN'REC KEY LIN'KEY
    GETNXT LIN INTO LIN'REC
    DO UNTIL LIN'CTL # 0 OR LIN'DOC'TYPE # LIN'KDOC'TYPE OR &
        LIN'HDR'NO # LIN'KHDR'NO
        CALL LOOKUP'SUBS
!!      CALL CREATE'940'OTHER'CHARGES'REC
        GETNXT LIN INTO LIN'REC
    LOOP
RETURN

LOOKUP'SUBS:
    SUB'KDOC'TYPE = HDR'DOC'TYPE
    SUB'KHDR'NO = HDR'NO
    SUB'KLIN'NO = LIN'NO
    SUB'KNO = 0
    USE SUB INTO SUB'REC KEY SUB'KEY
    GETNXT SUB INTO SUB'REC
    DO UNTIL SUB'CTL # 0 OR SUB'KDOC'TYPE # SUB'DOC'TYPE OR &
            SUB'KHDR'NO # SUB'HDR'NO OR SUB'KLIN'NO # SUB'LIN'NO
        PO'DETAIL = SPACE
        DETAIL'CODE = "02"
        PRINT #33, DETAIL'CODE; CHR(9);
        LINE'ITEM'COUNTER = LINE'ITEM'COUNTER + 1
        LINE'ITEM'NUM = LINE'ITEM'COUNTER
        PRINT #33, LINE'ITEM'NUM; CHR(9);
        CALL LOOKUP'PART'GTIN
        CALL LOOKUP'PDD'INFO
        CALL LOOKUP'QUANTITY

        NUM'OF'RECORDS = NUM'OF'RECORDS + 1
        GETNXT SUB INTO SUB'REC
    LOOP
RETURN

\COPYF INT IN

LOOKUP'PART'GTIN:
    INT'SPACE = SPACE
    INT'TRK'NO = LIN'TRK'NO
    INT'ATT'NO1 = SUB'ATT'NO1
    INT'TYPE = "V"
    INT'NAM'NO = UCC'INT'VEN'NO
    INT'UOM'NO = 1
    \SETKEY INT MODE="KEY" APID="IN"
    USE INT INTO INT'REC KEY INT'KEY
    IF INT'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot find GTIN for this part"
        \KERROR INT APID="IN" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        CALL DO'ERR
        SKIPPED'ORDER = OEHDR'RCN
        GOTO ABORT
    ELSE
        IF INT'PART[1;1] # "0" THEN
            ENTRY = "Invalid GTIN for this part"
            \KERROR INT APID="IN" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            SKIPPED'ORDER = OEHDR'RCN
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            \STRIP INT'PART 3
            ITEM'ID'GTIN = INT'PART
            PRINT #33, ITEM'ID'GTIN; CHR(9);
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

LOOKUP'PDD'INFO:
    MASTER'STYLE = ""
    PRINT #33, MASTER'STYLE; CHR(9);

    COLOR'CODE = ""
    PRINT #33, COLOR'CODE; CHR(9);

    SIZE'CODE = ""
    PRINT #33, SIZE'CODE; CHR(9);
RETURN

LOOKUP'QUANTITY:
    CALL FIND'UOM
    CALL LOOKUP'SELLING'PRICE
RETURN

FIND'UOM:
    UOM'KNO = LIN'UOM'NO
    USE UOM INTO UOM'REC KEY UOM'KEY
    IF UOM'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot find unit of measure"
        \KERROR UOM APID="IN" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        CALL DO'ERR
        GOTO ABORT
    ELSE
        IF UOM'NO = 1 THEN
            QUANTITY'ORDERED = SUB'ORDER'QTY
            PRINT #33, QUANTITY'ORDERED; CHR(9);
            PO'UOM = "EA"
            PRINT #33, PO'UOM; CHR(9);
            TOTAL'QUANTITY = TOTAL'QUANTITY + QUANTITY'ORDERED
        ELSE
            QUANTITY'ORDERED = ((UOM'NUNITS/UOM'DUNITS) * SUB'ORDER'QTY)
            PRINT #33, QUANTITY'ORDERED; CHR(9);
            PO'UOM = "EA"
            PRINT #33, PO'UOM; CHR(9);
            TOTAL'QUANTITY = TOTAL'QUANTITY + QUANTITY'ORDERED
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

MAP1 A4'UCC'NO,S,10
MAP1 DYE'UCC'NO,S,10

LOOKUP'SELLING'PRICE:
    IF A4'UCC'NO = UCC'KNO OR DYE'UCC'NO = UCC'KNO THEN
        SELLING'UNIT'PRICE = "0.0000"
        TOTAL'LINE'ITEM = "0.0000"
    ELSE
        SELLING'UNIT'PRICE = ""
        TOTAL'LINE'ITEM = ""
    ENDIF
    PRINT #33, SELLING'UNIT'PRICE; CHR(9);

    PRINT #33, TOTAL'LINE'ITEM;
    PRINT #33, CHR(13) + CHR(10);                   !!CRLF
RETURN


CREATE'940'TRAILER:
    TRAILER = SPACE
    TRAILER'RECORD = "09"
    PRINT #33, TRAILER'RECORD; CHR(9);

    NUM'OF'RECORDS = NUM'OF'RECORDS + 1
    RECORD'COUNT = NUM'OF'RECORDS
    PRINT #33, RECORD'COUNT; CHR(9);

    TOTAL'QUANTITY'ORDERED = TOTAL'QUANTITY
    PRINT #33, TOTAL'QUANTITY'ORDERED; CHR(9);

    IF OEHDR'BOX'COUNT = 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Must have more than 1 box in shipment"
        \KERROR HDR APID="PO" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        CALL DO'ERR
        GOTO ABORT
    ENDIF
    NUMBER'OF'CASES = STR(OEHDR'BOX'COUNT)
    PRINT #33, NUMBER'OF'CASES; CHR(9);

    \STRIP COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE 3
    IF COD'FOR'MERCHANDISE = "N" THEN
        TOTAL'PO'AMOUNT = ""
        PRINT #33, TOTAL'PO'AMOUNT;
    ELSE
        \HDRSUM OEHDR BALANCE="TOTAL" LOCAL'TOTALS="Y"
        IF TOTAL = 0 OR OEHDR'SHP'TOTAL = 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "COD order has "+(TOTAL/100 USING "###,###.##")+ &
                " total with "+(OEHDR'SHP'TOTAL/100 USING "###,###.##")+" committed"
            \KERROR HDR APID="PO" MODE="KEY" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ENDIF
        TOTAL'PO'AMOUNT = (TOTAL/100 USING "#########.####")
        PRINT #33, TOTAL'PO'AMOUNT;
    ENDIF
    PRINT #33, CHR(13) + CHR(10);                   !!CRLF
    TOTAL'QUANTITY = 0
RETURN

MSG'DID="POMSG"
LOOKUP'OE'ORDER:
    O2P'KPDOC'TYPE = WRK'MODE
    O2P'KPNO = WRK'STRK'NO
    USE O2P INTO O2P'REC KEY O2P'KEY
    IF O2P'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Cannot find purchase order to lookup order"
        CALL DO'ERR
        ABORT'FLAG = 1
        GOTO ABORT
    ENDIF
RETURN

LOOKUP'CREDIT'HOLD:
    OEHDR'SPACE = SPACE
    OEHDR'KLOC'NO = O2P'OLOC'NO
    OEHDR'KDOC'TYPE = O2P'ODOC'TYPE
    OEHDR'KNO = O2P'ONO
    USE OEHDR INTO OEHDR'REC KEY OEHDR'KEY
    IF OEHDR'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "Order not found in current file"
        \KERROR HDR MODE="KEY" APID="OE" CNO="N" ALTKEY="OEHDR"
        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        CALL DO'ERR
        SF = 1
    ENDIF
    IF OEHDR'HOLD'YN # "N" AND OEHDR'HOLD'YN # "O" THEN
        ENTRY = "Order on credit hold " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
        CALL DO'ERR
        SF = 1
    ENDIF

    TRH'KNO = OEHDR'TRH'NO
    USE TRH INTO TRH'REC KEY TRH'KEY
    IF TRH'CTL # 0 THEN
        ENTRY = "3: Cannot find terms"
        \KERROR TRH MODE="KEY" APID="AR" CNO="N"
        ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
            OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            SKIPPED'ORDER = OEHDR'RCN
            GOTO ABORT
    ELSE
        IF TRH'CTP'NO > 0 THEN                       !!Credit Card
            IF OEHDR'SOURCE = "WB" THEN
                ATQT'KSOURCE = "WB"
            ELSE
                ATQT'KSOURCE = "OE"
            ENDIF
            ATQT'KCNO = UB'CNO
            ATQT'KSPECIAL[1;4] = OEHDR'LOC'NO USING "#ZZZ"
            ATQT'KSPECIAL[5;1] = OEHDR'DOC'TYPE
            ATQT'KSPECIAL[6;7] = OEHDR'NO USING "#ZZZZZZ"
            ATQT'KSPECIAL[13;4] = OEHDR'SHIPMENT USING "#ZZZ"
            USE ATQT INTO ATQ'REC KEY ATQT'KEY
            IF ATQT'CTL # 0 THEN
                IF ATQT'KSOURCE = "OE" THEN
                    ATQT'KSOURCE = "WB"
                ELSE
                    ATQT'KSOURCE = "OE"
                ENDIF
                USE ATQT INTO ATQ'REC KEY ATQT'KEY
            ENDIF
            IF ATQT'CTL = 0 THEN
                ENTRY = "Authorization record found " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                IF ATQT'KSOURCE # OEHDR'SOURCE THEN
                    ENTRY = ENTRY + " Source fixed to "+ATQT'KSOURCE
                ENDIF
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                CALL DO'ERR
                SF = 0
                IF ATQ'APPROVAL = "" AND ATQ'STATUS # "A" THEN
                    \HDRSUM OEHDR BALANCE="TOTAL" LOCAL'TOTALS="Y"
                    IF TOTAL > 0 AND ATQ'AMT > 0 THEN
                        ENTRY = "Order not authorized " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                            OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO+ " APPROVAL: "+ ATQ'APPROVAL +"-"+ ATQ'STATUS
                        \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                        CALL DO'ERR
                        SF = 4
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
            ELSE
                ENTRY = "1: Authorization record not found " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                             OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
                \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
                SF = 4
            ENDIF
            IF SF = 4 THEN
                SKIPPED'ORDER = OEHDR'RCN
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

LOOKUP'RURAL'ZIP:
    IF VIA'TBL'NO(1) # 0 THEN
        TBL'KNO = VIA'TBL'NO(1)
        USE TBL INTO TBL'REC KEY TBL'KEY
        IF TBL'CTL # 0 THEN
            ENTRY = "Cannot find freight table"
            \KERROR TBL MODE="KEY" APID="IN" CNO="N"
            ENTRY = ENTRY + " for Order " + OEHDR'LOC'NO + "-" + &
                         OEHDR'DOC'TYPE + "-" + OEHDR'NO
            \LABLOGGER ENTRY LNAME
            CALL DO'ERR
            GOTO ABORT
        ELSE
            IF TBL'RURAL'CHK = "Y" THEN
                RZC'KZIP = TAD'ZIP[1;5]
                USE RZC INTO RZC'REC KEY RZC'KEY
                IF RZC'CTL = 0 THEN
                    IF RZC'ZIP[1;5] = TAD'ZIP[1;5] THEN
                        IF TAD'RES'YN = "Y" THEN
                            COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "2" !!Rural Residential
                            PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                        ELSE
                            COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "4" !!Rural Commercial
                            PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                        ENDIF
                    ENDIF
                ELSE
                    IF TAD'RES'YN = "Y" THEN
                        COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "2" !!Urban Residential
                        PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                    ELSE
                        COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "0" !!Urban Commercial
                        PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                    ENDIF
                ENDIF
            ELSE
                IF TAD'RES'YN = "Y" THEN
                    COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "2"    !!Urban Residential
                    PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                ELSE
                    COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "0"    !!Urban Commercial
                    PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
                ENDIF
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
    ELSE
        IF TAD'RES'YN = "Y" THEN
            COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "2"    !!Urban Residential
            PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
        ELSE
            COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL = "0"    !!Urban Commercial
            PRINT #33, COMMERCIAL'OR'RESIDENTIAL; CHR(9);
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
RETURN

E'POL940'PRW'STK'1:
    \\TSTFUNC
    \TABEDTC PRWSTK PRW'STK MAND="N" EXITDSP="(30)" APID="SY"
RETURN


COPY "HOBSUB.CPY[PO]"

